metadata.

APIs.guru OpenAPI directory metadata
====================================

The nango-catalog helper can read a user-provided APIs.guru list.json snapshot
to build provider/spec crosswalk metadata:

Upstream: https://api.apis.guru/v2/list.json
Project: https://github.com/APIs-guru/openapi-directory

APIs.guru entries have mixed provenance. Some definitions are contributed under
CC0, while other public-source definitions may require separate review before
redistribution. nango-catalog records the snapshot retrieval timestamp and
SHA-256 digest, but treats APIs.guru matches as review candidates by default.
Do not bundle third-party OpenAPI spec content or generated manifests from
those specs unless the specific source has been reviewed as redistributable.
